    <string name="tutorial_welcome_title">Welcome to UnitCalc! 🎉</string>
    <string name="tutorial_welcome_desc">Compare prices across different capacities, packages, and units easily to find the best deal!</string>

    <string name="tutorial_home_units_title">1. Category &amp; Reference Qty ⚖️</string>
    <string name="tutorial_home_units_desc">Choose Weight, Volume, or Count tabs. Underneath, select the standard quantity (e.g. 100g, 1kg, 100ml) to define the baseline for price comparison.</string>

    <string name="tutorial_home_best_title">2. Smart Best Choice 🏆</string>
    <string name="tutorial_home_best_desc">Fill in the price and capacity for each product. The app automatically calculates the best deal and highlights it with a prominent "BEST CHOICE" badge and detailed savings!</string>

    <string name="tutorial_home_actions_title">3. New, Add, and Save 💾</string>
    <string name="tutorial_home_actions_desc">Use "New Comparison" to clear and start fresh. Tap "Add Product" to add more items. Tap "Save" to keep this comparison in your local History.</string>

    <string name="tutorial_history_title">4. History &amp; Reordering 🗂️</string>
    <string name="tutorial_history_desc">In the History tab, you can tap any previous session to load it back. You can also drag and drop items vertically to reorder them or edit their titles easily.</string>

    <string name="tutorial_settings_title">5. Custom Settings ⚙️</string>
    <string name="tutorial_settings_desc">Go to Settings to customize small and large units for Weight and Volume (e.g., fl.oz, gal, oz, lb). All product inputs will update automatically!</string>

